^{:go/end 372} (go/method unpack "unpack returns the filename and line and column number for a file offset.\nIf adjusted is set, unpack will return the filename and line information\npossibly adjusted by //line comments; otherwise those comments are ignored.\n" [^{:tag (* File)} f ^int offset ^bool adjusted] :results [^string filename ^int line ^int column]
